From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:14:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: light up the sidebar line under the mouse

Machines, spaces, tree lines, collapsed summaries and waiting agents
light up while the mouse is over them, a step brighter than the
alternate-tab shade. Only plain and shaded cells change, so the focused
tab and space keep their highlight. Like the shading it needs the
terminal's background colour, and it is off during drags.

